title: Die Rote Fahne
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and rote_fahne_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.rote_fahne_timer = 3;
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.c_paper_banned = 0;
!}
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs

= Die Rote Fahne

The editors want one subject on the front page every day for a month, with leaflets and meetings to follow it into the districts. [? if repression >= 50 : The Prussian ministry has banned the paper before, and it is looking for a reason to do it again. ?]

- @murders: Print the names of the murdered.
- @frontline: Appeal to the social democratic workers.
- @noske: Print Noske's orders of January 1919.
- @debate: Open the paper to every current.
- @easy_discard

@murders
subtitle: Every worker shot "while trying to escape", and the judge who freed the killer.
on-arrival: {!
Q.worker_support += 4;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

By the end of the month the list has three hundred names. A deputy reads it out in the Reichstag.

@frontline
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Relations with the SPD improve. The Left will call it begging.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids appeals to the social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.spd_relation += 7;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

For a month the paper prints letters from union branches and works councils that want joint action, and asks their leaders every day why not.

@noske
subtitle: Militancy rises and the SPD is furious. [? if repression >= 50 : The editors think it is even odds the paper is banned. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.spd_relation -= 8;
Q.militancy += 4;
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
if (Q.repression >= 50 && Math.random() < 0.5) {
    Q.c_paper_banned = 1;
    Q.rote_fahne_timer = 7;
    Q.worker_support -= 2;
    RG.news('Die Rote Fahne banned', 2);
}
!}

The paper reprints the orders, with the photographs of the dead in Lichtenberg beside them. [? if c_paper_banned = 1 : On the fourth day the police seal the presses. The paper will not appear for months. ?]

@debate
subtitle: Every current is pleased to be heard. The Zentrale's line looks less certain.
on-arrival: {!
for (var f of Q.factions) {
    Q[f + '_satisfaction'] += 5;
}
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] -= 3;
}
!}

Articles from every wing of the party fill the pages, and the letters page runs to four.
